8/304804/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304804/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304804/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304804/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304804/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">无数颗星星汇成河流，高悬于天际，亘古至今。<br />它们目睹了这片土地的从无到有，目睹了神话与传说的根源，以及一切死亡和新生。<br />这里有着太多奇异的事物，胜过无垠的空旷与虚无。一切旅行的源头，都是一点微不足道的好奇心。不可计数的梦想，不可计数的名字，交织成今夜的曲目。<br />星星坠入大地，微弱的亮光转瞬即逝。<br />“……真美丽。”<br />即使是声音不能到达的地方，依然有微光在闪烁。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304804\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304807.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b2/Belonging-304807.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“星子的絮语”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Whispers of the Stars\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一个微笑，几声呢喃，数段乐音。<br />在这场采访中，受访者以表情、动作和这把形制古老的琴，展示了其真诚的交流意愿。最终，我们收获了如上的叙谈记录。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304808.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/09/Belonging-304808.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“远行的节拍”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Piece of the Journey\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />24<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在我们询问这顶头饰的来历时，受访者为我们演奏了一段欢快的音乐。据另一位受访者辨识，这是他们在演出途中，路过一个小镇时听到的节庆小调。<br />我们最终将头冠和这首曲目一并收录。或许音乐用于交流时，自有其巧妙之处。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304809.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1d/Belonging-304809.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“停滞的星河”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Starry Moment\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>采访前，我们听说了一则传言：当没有人正看向受访者时，这些疑似星座的神秘符号会环绕受访者周身，如星河般缓慢流淌。<br />遗憾的是，我们没能在采访中验证这则传言。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B61.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 群星齐唱时1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B61.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B61.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B61.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B61.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B61.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B61.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B62.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 群星齐唱时2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B62.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B62.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B62.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B62.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B62.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BE%A4%E6%98%9F%E9%BD%90%E5%94%B1%E6%97%B62.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">群星齐唱时 <small style=\"color: grey\">Choir of the Stars</small></span></span>"}}